      {
        "_id": "wcHvgBackstab001",
        "effects": [],
        "flags": {},
        "folder": null,
        "img": "icons/svg/blood.svg",
        "name": "Backstab (Ex)",
        "ownership": {
          "default": 0
        },
        "sort": 0,
        "system": {
          "abilityType": "ex",
          "combatChanges": [
            [
              "attackOptional",
              "mwak",
              "",
              "&featDamage.precision",
              "2d6"
            ]
          ],
          "combatChangesApplySpecialActionsOnce": false,
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The golem deals +2d6 precision damage when its target would be denied its Agility bonus to AC, or when the golem flanks the target. The extra damage is not multiplied on a critical hit.</p><p>A target immune to critical hits is also immune to Backstab. The golem must be able to see and reach a vital spot and cannot use Backstab against concealment. The golem cannot choose to make its Backstab damage nonlethal.</p><p><strong>Foundry:</strong> select Backstab in the claw attack-options dialog when these conditions are met.</p>"
          },
          "featType": "trait",
          "source": "World of Warcraft: Monster Guide, p. 86; World of Warcraft: The Roleplaying Game, p. 81",
          "uniqueId": "wc-harvest-golem-backstab"
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      {
        "_id": "wcHvgKeenClaw001",
        "effects": [],
        "flags": {},
        "folder": null,
        "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
        "name": "Keen Claws (Ex)",
        "ownership": {
          "default": 0
        },
        "sort": 0,
        "system": {
          "abilityType": "ex",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The golem's claws function as +1 keen daggers, producing the listed 17-20 threat range. The golem's full attack uses two claws.</p><p>When the golem is destroyed, the claws lose their magical qualities but remain usable as eight masterwork daggers. They are awkward for other creatures: another wielder takes a -2 attack penalty with them (a net -1 after the masterwork bonus). They normally sell for no more than 100 gp each.</p>"
          },
          "featType": "trait",
          "source": "World of Warcraft: Monster Guide, p. 86",
          "uniqueId": "wc-harvest-golem-keen-claws"
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      {
        "_id": "wcHvgMagicImmune",
        "effects": [],
        "flags": {},
        "folder": null,
        "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
        "name": "Immunity to Magic (Su)",
        "ownership": {
          "default": 0
        },
        "sort": 0,
        "system": {
          "abilityType": "su",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The harvest golem is immune to any spell or spell-like ability that allows spell resistance. A spell with the fire descriptor is the exception and affects the golem normally.</p><p><strong>Foundry:</strong> resolve this rule when a spell targets the golem. A blanket spell-immunity flag is deliberately not used because it would incorrectly block the fire exception.</p>"
          },
          "featType": "trait",
          "source": "World of Warcraft: Monster Guide, p. 86",
          "uniqueId": "wc-harvest-golem-magic-immunity"
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      {
        "_id": "wcHvgLifeless001",
        "effects": [],
        "flags": {},
        "folder": null,
        "img": "icons/svg/mystery-man.svg",
        "name": "Lifeless Mien (Ex)",
        "ownership": {
          "default": 0
        },
        "sort": 0,
        "system": {
          "abilityType": "ex",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>While motionless, the golem resembles an ordinary, lifeless scarecrow. A creature that passes within 30 feet can attempt a DC 20 Spot check to recognize that it is animate.</p>"
          },
          "featType": "trait",
          "range": {
            "long": null,
            "units": "ft",
            "value": 30
          },
          "source": "World of Warcraft: Monster Guide, p. 86",
          "uniqueId": "wc-harvest-golem-lifeless-mien"
